collectdata
===========
AI generated by GitHub Copilot (DeepSeek V4 Pro), v1.0

Reads temperatures.csv, shows the data in a FOX GUI and imports the file into
MySQL (`import_temperatures`, runs on the server, see
../docs/mysql-import-plan.md).


Building
--------

    git submodule update --init --recursive
    ./reconfigure.sh            # aclocal/automake/autoconf + ./configure
    make -j$(nproc)
    make check                  # unit tests (no database needed)

Produced binaries:

* `collectdata`          - GUI application, needs the FOX toolkit (1.6 or 1.7)
* `import_temperatures`  - MySQL importer, needs `mysql_config`

`./reconfigure.sh --without-fox` builds only `import_temperatures` (no X11
libraries needed); `--without-mysql` builds only the GUI. Without FOX the GUI
target is skipped automatically (configure prints a warning).


Docker
------

Same layout and base image (debian:trixie) as the lotr_analyzer containers, so
both projects can be built/run on the same host. The submodules have to be
checked out on the host first.

    # build everything (image: pi-sensor-build-container)
    ./build_container/run_container.sh
    ./build_container/run_container.sh make check
    ./build_container/run_container.sh ./reconfigure.sh --without-fox
    ./build_container/run_container.sh bash          # interactive shell

    # run the importer (image: pi-sensor-run-container, no compiler, no X11)
    ./run_container/run_container.sh                                # import
    ./run_container/run_container.sh ./import_temperatures --dry-run -v

The run container mounts the current directory as `/workspace`,
`$PI_SENSOR_STAGING` (default `/srv/pi_sensor`) as `/srv/pi_sensor`,
`~/.pi_sensor.ini` and `/run/mysqld` (each only if it exists), and runs with
the calling uid/gid.


Directory layout
----------------

    src/            GUI only (main.cc, main_window.*, FOX)
    src_shared/     libcore.a, GUI and database independent (csv_util,
                    DataRecord, filters, plots, logging, FileBusy,
                    ImportRunner/ImportResume)
    src_importer/   import_temperatures (main.cc, DbImportSink.*)
    src_test/       unit tests (test_csv_util)
    config/         Configfile2 settings infrastructure (libconfig.a)
    common/         test helpers (TestUtils, ColBuilder)
    tools/          lotr_analyzer tools copy (arg, debug, thread, database layer)
    cpputils/       submodule with the shared utility classes
    build_container/, run_container/   docker build/run environments
